622325_9943522335725729_1856700708677810822_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KKMwW2SRWP0Q7kNvwF6IhBC&_nc_oc=AdrVUOHuV30FL5NH3chPYrxStk3F1V7NdGMpJQMAVGc5_X-AOX6pwh2W3Fyss-uDzLg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS_bBm2GM_2vukQQshYxmhunAmXmTp18KjJvQfezcQ4_w&oe=6B047F27"}, "display_name": "Hockey Goalie Pro", "keywords": ["Hockey", "Sports", "Goalie", "Sim", "ice"], "long_description": "**\ud83c\udfd1Become a pro goalkeeper using the best VR Mixed Reality Hockey game on Meta Quest!\ud83c\udfd1** Improve your fitness, reaction time and health as you climb up the ranks and become a Hockey Goalie Pro! Supporting both controller and hand tracking for optimised training!\n\n\n**\ud83d\udc51 Rise through the Ranks**\n\nWatch as your space is transformed into various Hockey Stadiums with Mixed Reality environments. Complete Challenges as you guard the goal and improve your rank!\n\n{1606629710024374}\n\n**\ud83e\udd4a Fitness**\n\nImprove your reaction time and your health as a Hockey Goalie in VR with BOTH Hand tracking or controller support and predictive reaction technology for close-to-real life experience!\n\n{2136692136754244}\n\n**\ud83c\udfd2 Upgrade your Gear**\n\nSpend some time browsing the shop to customise and upgrade your gear and access new areas.\n\n\n{1231816687869118}", "short_description": "Bring the stadium to you and transform your backyard, room or field into a roaring arena as you partake in the most realistic Mixed Reality Hockey Goalie experience."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1kyYf4FSDKiWmfvurtg_5Djh0k6ZO8JyhohL3DE6dyt0/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Dylan Van Beek", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@DylanVanBeek", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "conte